>{cmana kevna zbasu} is a tanru, {cmana} modifies {kevna}
>and then {cmana kevna} modifies {zbasu}. A cu before zbasu
>would be ungrammatical, because cu can only go in front of
>the whole selbri, which in this case is {cmana kevna zbasu}.
