To expand on xorxes' explanation, consider "This is a comic book 
shelf".  The thing you're pointing at isn't a comic, nor a book; it's a 
shelf - the LAST of the string of description.  Lojban works like that.  It 
is a comic-type-of-book, and then a comic-book type of shelf.

So, the "cmana kevna zbasu" that "mi" is/is-doing winds up:
   mountain (cmana) type of cavity (kevna) --> mountain cave
   cmana kevna (mountain-cave) type of maker/builder (zbasu).
So you are a mountian-cave builder.


